{"text": "I had passed the Magic Shop several times before, but it was my little son Gip who finally pulled me over to its window. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He held my finger tightly and hauled me right up to the glass, where all kinds of tricks were on display. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There were magic balls, magic hens, wonderful cones, puppets for ventriloquists, and packs of cards that looked quite ordinary. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If I were rich, said Gip, pointing at the Disappearing Egg, I would buy myself that one. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He also wanted the Crying Baby, Very Human, and a mysterious box with a label that said, Buy One and Astonish Your Friends. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Anything vanishes under those cones, he told me seriously, because I have read about it in a book. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He pointed out that the Vanishing Halfpenny was placed upside down, so that nobody could see how the trick was done. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I reminded him that his birthday was less than a hundred days away, and he said nothing but held my finger more tightly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So we went in, and it was not until I was inside that I noticed how strange the little shop really was.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "p", "a", "s", "s", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "M", "a", "g", "i", "c", " ", "S", "h", "o", "p", " ", "s", "e", "v", "e", "r", "a", "l", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "s", " ", "b", "e", "f", "o", "r", "e", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "i", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "m", "y", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "s", "o", "n", " ", "G", "i", "p", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "f", "i", "n", "a", "l", "l", "y", " ", "p", "u", "l", "l", "e", "d", " ", "m", "e", " ", "o", "v", "e", "r", " ", "t", "o", " ", "i", "t", "s", " ", "w", "i", "n", "d", "o", "w", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "h", "e", "l", "d", " ", "